(4. Standard workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Compliance Hub) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Open **Compliance Hub**.) Tj
T*
(2. Select **New case**.) Tj
T*
(3. Select the domain and severity.) Tj
T*
(4. Enter the facts and context.) Tj
T*
(5. Choose confidentiality and anonymous reporting when needed.) Tj
T*
(6. Create the case.) Tj
T*
(7. Search or filter the register.) Tj
T*
(8. Assign and progress the case through review, investigation, action, and closure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Vendor issue workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Create a vendor issue.) Tj
T*
(2. Assign a Compliance Officer.) Tj
T*
(3. Investigate the issue.) Tj
T*
(4. Complete a risk assessment.) Tj
T*
(5. Create a resolution.) Tj
T*
(6. Submit for approval when required.) Tj
T*
(7. Approve or reject the resolution.) Tj
T*
(8. Mark the issue resolved and closed.) Tj
T*
(9. Review the audit log and notifications.) Tj
